; WI-72 §2 (F31): the shipped ore processor with its recipe cleared - the one
; thing `ProcessorComponent.wiring_fault()` is asked about first.
;
; An inherited scene rather than a scene packed at runtime: `PackedScene.pack()`
; on an instantiated scene loses the base's authored PathComponent anchors, so a
; repacked module arrives with a broken interior AStar graph and the test would
; be measuring that instead.
;
; This is exactly the shape a mod ships - a real `.tscn` with one export wrong -
; and it lives under `tests/`, which the export preset excludes and
; `test_module_content.gd` never walks (that sweep reads `data/modules/`).

